  "query_preview": "period of on-and-off rainfall through early this \nweekend. There remains some uncertainty as to exactly when rain \nwill get going in our area, with most 12z CAMs suggesting later \nin the night to early Wednesday morning, while the 12z GFS and \nEuro try to start rain in the late evening hours. The best \nchances for precip (60 - 80%) on Wednesday night look to hold \nnorth of I-80. Increasing cloud cover associated with this \ndeveloping pattern will hold overnight lows between the upper \n50s to low 60s across the CWA.",
